只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A free, 100% self-hosted DeepSeek Harness plugin that unifies your on-chain and CEX assets.","id":"gh:1342742812","install_available":true,"language":"Python","name":"dsh-crypto-portfolio","slug":"0xRabit/dsh-crypto-portfolio","topics":["bitcoin","crypto","cryptoportfolio","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","ethereum"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A free, 100% self-hosted DeepSeek Harness plugin that unifies your on-chain and CEX assets."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-crypto-portfolio"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A free, 100% self-hosted DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin that unifies your **on-chain and CEX assets**"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" into one self-contained web dashboard."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Requires** `dsh` `0.1.1-rc.2` (Node `^22.19 || >=24`) · Python 3.9+ · `pip3 install requests pynac"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"Requires** `dsh` `0.1.1-rc.2` (Node `^22.19 || >=24`) · Python 3.9+ · `pip3 install requests pynacl`"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> **Twin project.** This dashboard is the twin of the SmartFolio Chrome extension: the extension put"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"s the same wallets in your toolbar, this one is the self-hosted, all-chains view that runs on your o"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"wn machine. Same idea, two shells — the dashboard is a DSH plugin and follows the DSH plugin convent"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ions, so it keeps its own name."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> Unofficial project, independently developed and maintained by community members."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Why it exists / The pain points"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"I built it because the pain points are real."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 1 · My money lives in seven places, and checking the total means opening six pages"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"EVM assets in DeBank, SOL and staking on-chain, BTC in a block explorer, plus Binance / Bybit / Back"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"pack / OKX / Bitget — each with its own app. Checking \"how much do I actually have\" meant hopping be"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"tween six pages, and it was easy to miss a wallet along the way."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**This plugin puts all of it on a single screen.**"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 2 · Assets that block explorers can't see"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Some money is genuinely invisible: native Solana stake accounts (`getParsedStakeAccounts` misses the"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"m), Hyperliquid L1 staked HYPE and spot balances, exchange earn/funding accounts. None of these are "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"plain SPL/ERC-20 tokens, so ordinary tools never read them."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**This plugin digs them out and prices them into your total** — including the 12.1 SOL staked in the"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" account above and the ~318 HYPE staked on Hyperliquid."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 3 · Dust coins and phishing tokens inflate the numbers"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"DeBank lists plenty of fake tokens — ETHG, for example, is a **phishing token with a manipulated pri"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ce** that once inflated one account by $570K."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**One-click blacklisting**: every token you blacklist is removed from totals, trends and historical "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"snapshots instantly."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### 4 · \"How much did I have last week?\""},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Without history there's no peace of mind."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Every refresh saves the last snapshot of the day** (SQLite, deduplicated by day); over time it dra"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ws a trend line that is uniquely yours:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **A zero-dependency web dashboard, launched from a real DSH plugin.** No framework, no CDN — Pytho"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"n stdlib + vanilla JS.\n- **Covers BTC / EVM / Solana / Dogecoin / Cardano / Hyperliquid L1 / CEX.** "},{"id":"p24s3","text":"DeBank's 73 chains, BTC P2SH+P2TR, native Solana staking, Dogecoin (BlockCypher), Cardano (Koios, in"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"cl. stake addresses), Hyperliquid's official API (staked HYPE + spot + perp equity + vault equity), "},{"id":"p24s5","text":"and read-only CEX keys (named `<exchange>_read`). Five exchanges are supported (Binance, Bybit, Back"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"pack, OKX, Bitget). Read-only CEX keys cover spot, OKX's funding sub-account and Backpack's futures "},{"id":"p24s7","text":"collateral account, including tokenised equities; on Bitget the spot account is summed with the real"},{"id":"p24s8","text":" futures accounts and the `S*` demo products are skipped, so play money never enters the total.\n- **"},{"id":"p24s9","text":"Global filters.** Category (BTC / EVM / Solana / Dogecoin / Cardano / CEX), wallet and chain dropdow"},{"id":"p24s10","text":"ns drive every panel — total, wallet-share pie, trend, chain distribution, token table.\n- **Up to fi"},{"id":"p24s11","text":"ve block explorers per wallet.** Each wallet card ends in a row of explorer icons — the provider thi"},{"id":"p24s12","text":"s app actually reads from comes first (DeBank · bitaps · Jupiter · Dogechain · Cardanoscan), then th"},{"id":"p24s13","text":"e other mainstream explorers in popularity order (Etherscan, mempool.space, Solscan, Blockchair, CEx"},{"id":"p24s14","text":"plorer, …). Dogecoin shows three and Cardano four, because that is how many credible explorers those"},{"id":"p24s15","text":" chains have. CEX rows show the exchange mark instead, since an exchange account has no explorer pag"},{"id":"p24s16","text":"e.\n- **Free + paid data sources, clearly labeled.** EVM uses DeBank with two providers: paid `debank"},{"id":"p24s17","text":"-pro` (badged \"PAID\", with a registration link) and free keyless `debank-public` fallback; CEX rows "},{"id":"p24s18","text":"always show Binance/Bybit/Backpack/OKX/Bitget with \"get API key\" links to each exchange (OKX and Bit"},{"id":"p24s19","text":"get also take the key's passphrase). Each source displays when it last succeeded.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## How it integrates with DSH"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Not a wrapper — a real plugin:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The dashboard also watches its own Python sources: editing `tracker/*.py` restarts\nit within a coupl"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"e of seconds (same process, no DSH restart), and static files are\nread from disk on every request, s"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"o a UI change is a page reload. Settings → Service\nhas a *Restart the service* button for the cases "},{"id":"p27s4","text":"where you want to force it."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- Declares a `dsh.bundle` manifest (`cordis.patch.yml`), so it installs with `dsh plugin add`.\n- `ap"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ply(ctx)` hooks into the Cordis lifecycle: seeds user-local `profiles/default` from public templates"},{"id":"p28s3","text":" on first run, spawns the dashboard as a child process, and stops it cleanly on `ctx.on('dispose')`."},{"id":"p28s4","text":"\n- Exposes JSON APIs (`GET /api/refresh`, `/api/history`, `/api/tokens`, ...) that an agent can call"},{"id":"p28s5","text":" directly, in addition to the web UI."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Privacy (important)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"This repository contains **no private keys, no private wallets, no balances** — `tracker/config.py` "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ships with `WALLETS = []` and empty keys. All private configs live in git-ignored local `profiles/`."},{"id":"p30s3","text":" Clone it, review it, run it with confidence."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **`dsh` `0.1.1-rc.2`** (or a compatible release within the same pre-release line)\nand **Node `^22."},{"id":"p33s2","text":"19.0 || >=24.0.0`** — the range DSH itself declares.\n- **Python 3.9+** with two pip packages:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"These are ordinary runtime dependencies, not vendored, so `pip` can pick the\nbuild that matches your"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ordinary runtime dependencies, not vendored, so `pip` can pick the\nbuild that matches your platform."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### From npm (recommended)"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Installs prebuilt code and needs **no build permission**:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### From a tarball (offline / air-gapped)"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### From GitHub"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"This package is plain JavaScript + Python with **no build step**, so its\n`prepare` is a no-op and pn"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"pm does not need you to allowlist a build script —\nunlike plugins that ship TypeScript sources. Pin "},{"id":"p43s3","text":"a commit SHA anyway, so a\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
